# Local ad-hoc test/diagnostic runs against real game installs or real mods.
# These can contain extracted/rebuilt Skyrim or Crimson Desert assets and must
# never be committed or published.
crimsonforge_test/
diag_*/
exe-smoke/
geometry_diagnostic_*/
out_auto_retest*/
real_mod_test/
_pynifly_probe/
*_log.txt

# Vendored PyNifly ships Bethesda-format reference skeletons, a Blender scene,
# and a standalone .exe tool alongside its Python source. sky2cd's build and
# release process intentionally excludes these (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md);
# keep them out of version control for the same reason.
src/sky2cd/vendor/io_scene_nifly/skeletons/
src/sky2cd/vendor/io_scene_nifly/blender_assets/
src/sky2cd/vendor/io_scene_nifly/hkxcmd.exe
